& = 3^{\beta b / 2}\left(\frac{3\pi}{m\beta} \right)^{N/2}
\end{align*}
where the inequality follows from Lemma \ref{lem:quad_bd}. Thus,
\[\log \Lambda \leq \frac{N}{2} \log\frac{3\pi}{m\beta} + \frac{\beta b}{2}\log3\]
